<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 11:30:03 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>华尔街从人工智能的狂热转向悲观</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/newsletters/2026-11-26/wall-street-flips-from-ai-euphoria-to-gloom</link><description>美国股市多年来从未如此波动过。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/newsletters/2026-11-26/wall-street-flips-from-ai-euphoria-to-gloom'&gt;华尔街从人工智能的狂热转向悲观&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Wall Street Flips From AI Euphoria to Gloom&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/newsletters/2026-11-26/wall-street-flips-from-ai-euphoria-to-gloom</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 10:56:52 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>Couche-Tard 认为 Zabka 模式已扩展到波兰和罗马尼亚以外的地区</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/couche-tard-sees-zabka-model-expanding-beyond-poland-romania</link><description>Alimentation Couche-Tard Inc. 计划将 Zabka Group SA 的便利店模式带入更多欧洲市场，因为这家加拿大零售商准备完成其有史以来最大的收购。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/couche-tard-sees-zabka-model-expanding-beyond-poland-romania'&gt;Couche-Tard 认为 Zabka 模式已扩展到波兰和罗马尼亚以外的地区&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Couche-Tard Sees Zabka Model Expanding Beyond Poland, Romania&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/couche-tard-sees-zabka-model-expanding-beyond-poland-romania</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 11:00:00 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>美国通胀数据助长加息押注，金价小幅走低</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/gold-edges-lower-as-us-inflation-data-fuels-bets-for-rate-hikes</link><description>金价在周三上涨后小幅走低，因通胀数据强化了美联储将进一步加息的押注。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/gold-edges-lower-as-us-inflation-data-fuels-bets-for-rate-hikes'&gt;美国通胀数据助长加息押注，金价小幅走低&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Gold Wavers Near 15-Month Low as Traders Eye Fed Path, AI Stocks&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/gold-edges-lower-as-us-inflation-data-fuels-bets-for-rate-hikes</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 00:18:09 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>裕信银行扫清了接管德国商业银行的最后障碍</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-26/unicredit-clears-final-hurdle-to-take-over-commerzbank-video-mwxge90q</link><description>裕信银行提议首席执行官安德里亚·奥塞尔（Andrea Orcel）担任德国商业银行董事长，这家意大利银行正在采取行动，以控制其德国竞争对手，这是欧洲几十年来最大的银行业交易之一。彭博社的史蒂文·阿伦斯报道。 （来源：彭博社）&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-26/unicredit-clears-final-hurdle-to-take-over-commerzbank-video-mwxge90q'&gt;裕信银行扫清了接管德国商业银行的最后障碍&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：UniCredit Clears Final Hurdle to Take Over Commerzbank&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-26/unicredit-clears-final-hurdle-to-take-over-commerzbank-video-mwxge90q</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 11:12:46 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>亚洲股市在美国尾盘反弹后有望上涨：市场结束</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/stock-market-today-dow-s-p-live-updates</link><description>在华尔街后期复苏将纳斯达克100指数从熊市边缘拉出来之后，亚洲股市似乎有望小幅上涨，同时对人工智能交易可持续性的持续担忧提振了美国国债。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/stock-market-today-dow-s-p-live-updates'&gt;亚洲股市在美国尾盘反弹后有望上涨：市场结束&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Global Stocks Climb as AI Trade Mounts a Comeback: Markets Wrap&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/stock-market-today-dow-s-p-live-updates</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 22:10:42 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>